# mhr-wsdl-java

Maven artifact **`au.gov.nehta:mhr-wsdl`** - MHR B2B WSDL resources and pre-generated JAX-WS/JAXB types. **Not** facade clients (**mhr-b2b-client-java**). **Not** Healthcare Identifiers (**hi-wsdl-java** / **hi-b2b-client-java**).

